  "title": "Mango and Egg Muffin",
  "blurb": "Toasted muffins with fried eggs, fresh mango, avocado and melted Cheddar.",
  "steps": [
    "Split the muffins in half and toast them until lightly golden.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a frying pan over medium heat and crack in the eggs. Fry for 3 to 4 minutes until the whites are set and the yolks are still runny, or cook to your preference.",
    "While the eggs cook, peel and slice the mango, discarding the stone. Halve and peel the avocado, then slice the flesh.",
    "Place the muffin halves on plates, cut side up. Top each half with a slice of cheese.",
    "Arrange the mango and avocado slices over the cheese, then place a fried egg on top of each muffin half."
